; The trump set. Winning 42 pp. 49-52 (S-0072-c, S-0073-c, S-0074-a,
; S-0074-b, S-0074-c, S-0075-a), p. 54 (S-0078-c).
; Rule, in our words: the bidder led trump and only one other player followed
; it: that setter holds the trumps (the bidder's partner was void too), and
; the bidder has lost control. When the bidder leads a double the trump
; holder is void in, he trumps it from the seat after the bidder, usually, and
; above all the 6-6, 5-5 and 4-4, which are or call for a ten; from the last
; seat he trumps only a trick that already holds count. His partner feeds
; count onto the bidder's double the trump holder may yet trump: the holder is
; still to play, has not shown out of trump, and a trump outside the feeder's
; hand is still live. Once every trump is played the set is over, and so is
; the feed. On lead with
; trumps as strong as the bidder's, he leads a high one at once.
; Replaces gates/c22-trump-the-double-from-the-left.silas. How it differs: the
; gate (as encoded) reads the trump set as "this setter followed and his
; partner did not"; the book's trigger also has the bidder's partner void
; (S-0074-a). The gate trumps every double alike; the book's "usually,
; especially the big doubles" is two rules, which allow the same tiles. The
; gate has no rule for the other setter (S-0073-c) or for the lead (S-0075-a).
; "As strong as the bidder's" compares two holdings; the closest viewer fact
; is holding the top trump still out.

(include book)

(policy trump-set
  (rule trump-a-big-double (play ruff)
    (viewer me)
    (left-setter me)
    (trump-set-alone me)
    (bidder-led doubled)
    (double doubled)
    (not (trump-tile doubled))
    (or (tile doubled 6-6) (tile doubled 5-5) (tile doubled 4-4))
    (own-legal ruff)
    (trump-tile ruff)
    (own-legal other)
    (trump-tile other))
  (rule trump-a-double (play ruff)
    (viewer me)
    (left-setter me)
    (trump-set-alone me)
    (bidder-led doubled)
    (double doubled)
    (not (trump-tile doubled))
    (own-legal ruff)
    (trump-tile ruff)
    (own-legal other)
    (trump-tile other))
  (rule trump-in-on-count (play ruff)
    (viewer me)
    (right-setter me)
    (trump-set-alone me)
    (bidder-led doubled)
    (double doubled)
    (not (trump-tile doubled))
    (count-on-trick)
    (own-legal ruff)
    (trump-tile ruff)
    (own-legal other)
    (trump-tile other))
  (rule feed-the-trump-holder (play give)
    (viewer me)
    (left-setter me)
    (partner me pard)
    (trump-set-alone pard)
    (may-yet-trump pard)
    (bidder-led doubled)
    (double doubled)
    (not (trump-tile doubled))
    (own-legal give)
    (count-tile give))
  (rule lead-a-high-trump (play lead)
    (viewer me)
    (setter me)
    (on-lead me)
    (trump-set-alone me)
    (own-legal lead)
    (boss-trump lead)))
